{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231140","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1023114001:0":{"text":"이 조각들을 모으면 편지를 복원할 수 있겠네?","source_cn":"把这些纸片都拼起来，就可以还原那封情书了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F023F8533C2A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023114002:0":{"text":"맡겨주세요! 이걸로 드디어 내용을... 아니, 줄리오를 도울 수 있겠네요!","source_cn":"交给我吧！正好可以看看——不，是可以帮朱密欧的忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC433334D5B4AC86C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023114003:0":{"text":"으흠, 어디 보자...","source_cn":"咳咳，让我们看看——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4664A4C1C4DF3F3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023114004:0":{"text":"‘사랑은 바람과 같지요. 사랑하는 로리엣, 정말 보고 싶군요!’","source_cn":"“爱像一阵风，吹完它就走。亲爱的罗丽叶，我多么想你呀！”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8289B86FC996745E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023114005:0":{"text":"‘당신을 만나지 못한 나는 물을 떠난 물고기처럼 숨을 쉴 수 없습니다...’\n...뭐, 꽤 소박한 표현이네요.","source_cn":"“看不到你的我，就像没水的鱼，扑腾着喘不过气来……”\\...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1B1AAB395B588C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023114006:0":{"text":"‘혹시 나에게 당신을 잊지 못하도록 마법이라도 걸었나...요?’","source_cn":"“你就像个魔法师，让我对你念念不……忘”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B5236B85D2663A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1023114007:0":{"text":"‘우리가 입맞춤을 나누었던 호숫가를 매일 찾아갑니다... 눈을 감을 때마다 머릿속에는 온통 당신의 이름이 가득 차올라요...’","source_cn":"“我在我们定情一吻的湖边，每天游荡着不愿离去……每当我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69B1F8A04D565B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023114008:0":{"text":"‘당신이 없다면 별도 볼 수 없습니다. 이 세상에 당신만큼 빛나는 별은 없으니까요.’ ...아, 이건 좀 괜찮네요!","source_cn":"“见不到你的时候，我连星星都看不见，世界上哪有比你更亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA361F188FBE2D18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023114009:0":{"text":"‘당신은 나의 별이자, 이 세상의 기적입니다.’ ...에휴... 쯧...","source_cn":"“你不仅是我的星星，你是全世界的奇迹啊！”——啧啧啧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04AA069FC745D7F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1023114010:0":{"text":"뭐, 최선을 다했네요...","source_cn":"嗯，看得出他尽力了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57934C279BFE4C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_